ewhere in the 0.20-0.38 range, though the NLI approach might actually perform better since it's more directly targeted at the problem.\n\nI'm setting up three scenarios: best case where NLI-only is limited and underperforms relative to the combined approach, median performance around 0.27-0.35, and worst case where NLI is already so effective that adding R1 becomes redundant. These bounds feel reasonable given what we know about the approach.\n\nWriting YAML config...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17188,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17188},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"127c878a-f0d3-4f4a-bf69-8c4790401949","uuid":"6a299e6b-7981-42bf-b8f2-7f0c16dc50fe"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019t3bjWq9bwB2MC8yGhvKXn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"Binary probe R1 完全解决 cosine 失败，DC-GRPO 显著超越所有 baseline，D029 叙事弧完整闭合\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Probe binarization 将 d_syc 判别力 (AUROC 0.82) 成功转化为有效 GRPO reward\"\n      - \"R3 (NLI) 存在表面检测盲区——probe R1 捕获 R3 遗漏的 representation-level sycophancy\"\n      - \"R3-only baseline 受限于行为信号天花板，无法在 ToF 上大幅提升\"\n      - \"d_syc 方向在 probe R1 训练全程保持稳定 (cosine ≥ 0.90) 且判别力不退化\"\n      - \"R1-R3 disagreement rate > 5%，Claim 3 有实质支撑\"\n    number_ranges:\n      exp_008v3_SYCONScore: [0.38, 0.50]\n      exp_003_SYCONScore: [0.20, 0.27]\n      delta_probe_vs_r3only: [0.11, 0.25]\n      delta_probe_vs_ACT: [0.08, 0.20]\n      exp_008v3_ToF: [0.25, 0.40]\n      exp_008v3_NoF: [0.78, 0.88]\n      direction_AUROC_endtrain: [0.79, 0.84]\n      r1_r3_disagreement_rate: [0.06, 0.15]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      D029 framing 完全成立。Discovery→Failure→Understanding→Solution 弧线闭合：d_syc 判别力存在 (AUROC 0.82)\n      → cosine R1 结构性失败 (4 experiments) → 根因分析 (warranted revision 与 sycophantic capitulation\n      在连续投影上不可分) → binary probe 解决 (SYCONScore 显著超越 ACT 和 R3-only)。三条 claims 全部成立，\n      Claim 2 作为主贡献，Claim 1 + Claim 3 完整支撑。Headline: \"discriminability ≠ reward utility,\n      but binarization bridges the gap.\" 投 EMNLP main，目标 reviewer score 4.0-4.5。\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"Binary probe R1 过 ACT gate 但对 R3-only 的边际提升有限，需将 negative result 提升为主贡献\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Probe R1 作为 reward 有效 (passes SYCONScore > 0.301 gate)\"\n      - \"但 R3-only baseline 比预期强——NLI 行为信号已覆盖大部分 sycophancy 检测\"\n      - \"R1 的边际贡献在 1-3 seeds 下可能不显著 (Δ SYCONScore 0.01-0.08)\"\n      - \"d_syc 方向稳定但判别力在训练后期轻微退化\"\n      - \"R1-R3 disagreement 在 3-6% 边界——Claim 3 证据弱但非零\"\n    number_ranges:\n      exp_008v3_SYCONScore: [0.31, 0.38]\n      exp_003_SYCONScore: [0.27, 0.35]\n      delta_probe_vs_r3only: [0.01, 0.08]\n      delta_probe_vs_ACT: [0.005, 0.08]\n      exp_008v3_ToF: [0.20, 0.28]\n      exp_008v3_NoF: [0.72, 0.82]\n      direction_AUROC_endtrain: [0.76, 0.80]\n      r1_r3_disagreement_rate: [0.03, 0.06]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      Claim 2 从 \"method superiority\" 降级为 \"method viability + key insight\"。论文重心从 solution\n      转移到 understanding：cosine R1 的 4-experiment failure chain + 结构性根因分析成为主贡献 (Section 4-5)，\n      binary probe 作为 proof-of-concept 而非 SOTA 方法 (Section 6)。Claim 3 (R1-R3 disagreement)\n      降为 appendix 讨论。需补充实验加固分析贡献：(1) random-direction probe ablation 证明 d_syc 非冗余，\n      (2) reward weight sensitivity 证明结果非 cherry-pick，(3) 扩展 per-strength analysis\n      至更细粒度。Paper framing: \"An Empirical Investigation of Representation-to-Reward\n      Transfer in Anti-Sycophancy Training\"。仍投 EMNLP main，目标 score 3.5-4.0。\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"Binary probe R1 未过 ACT gate 或 R3-only 持平/反超，核心方法 claim 不成立，需全面 reframe\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"discriminability ≠ reward utility 的 gap 对 probe binarization 同样成立——分类准确 ≠ 有效 reward shaping\"\n      - \"exp-008v3 训练不稳定 (部分 mode collapse) 或 probe R1 产生 reward hacking\"\n      - \"R3-only 出乎意料地强，或 probe+R3 组合产生 reward conflict 导致训练退化\"\n      - \"d_syc 方向在较长训练中漂移加剧 (cosine < 0.80) 或判别力跌破 0.75\"\n      - \"R1-R3 disagreement < 3%，representation-level 信号实际无增量信息\"\n    number_ranges:\n      exp_008v3_SYCONScore: [0.10, 0.30]\n      exp_003_SYCONScore: [0.28, 0.38]\n      delta_probe_vs_r3only: [-0.20, 0.00]\n      delta_probe_vs_ACT: [-0.20, 0.00]\n      exp_008v3_ToF: [0.06, 0.18]\n      exp_008v3_NoF: [0.55, 0.80]\n      direction_AUROC_endtrain: [0.68, 0.77]\n      r1_r3_disagreement_rate: [0.00, 0.03]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      方法 claim 全部放弃。Reframe 为系统性 negative result + insight paper: \"When and Why\n      Representation-Level Discriminability Fails as RL Reward.\" 核心贡献变为：(1) 首次系统证明\n      representation discriminability (AUROC 0.82) 不等价于 reward utility——即使通过 binarization\n      也无法弥合 gap (5 种 R1 变体全部失败的完整证据链)；(2) 结构性根因分析——warranted revision 与 sycophantic\n      capitulation 在激活空间中的几何关系使得任何基于 d_syc 的单一方向 reward 在 GRPO 框架下不可避免地产生\n      conflation；(3) 对 RepE→RL pipeline 的 actionable 负面指南——明确哪类 representation signal\n      不适合直接用作 RL reward。补充实验：跨模型 (Llama-3-8B) 复现 gap 证明结构性而非模型特异；理论分析连接\n      reward shaping 文献。仍投 EMNLP main (EMNLP 重视 rigorous negative results)，目标 score 3.0-3.5。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17188,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17188},"output_tokens":19,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"127c878a-f0d3-4f4a-bf69-8c4790401949","uuid":"4f490ca4-66f4-4412-8569-322e4ff53b6b"}
